<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: Czech Vertex sees higher 1996 net profit.</title>
<headline>Czech Vertex sees higher 1996 net profit.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1997-01-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Czech glass fibre maker Vertex a.s. said on Wednesday that it posted a 1996 net profit of 200 million crowns, according to preliminary figures, after posting a 117 million net profit the previous year.</p>
</text>
